structurecompasslegacy.limitation.abyssal_darklands=Selection and chance checks are interleaved with ground checks and other ruins. Terrain and random consumption have not been reproduced reliably.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.abyssal_decoration=Generation depends on preceding lakes, strongholds and a shared decoration random source. An isolated, reliable replay is not yet available.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.abyssal_shoggoth=Each dimension uses a different entry point, with preceding ore, lake or ruin random consumption and cross-chunk ground checks. Not yet adapted.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.omothol_spacing=Placement excludes nearby buildings using an in-memory position set, and random state depends on chunk generation order. Coordinates cannot be reproduced reliably without reading those records.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.binding_failed=Could not bind compatibility for this mod version. See the compatibility loading error in the log.
structurecompasslegacy.reason.recursive_chunk=Generation requested the same unfinished chunk recursively. Simulation stopped.
structurecompasslegacy.reason.unknown_structure=The server has no matching structure entry. Reopen the compass.
